{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9a472bb0-a1b4-8675-87b8-45e796e8d7cb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T12:37:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, parking violations, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I got a parking ticket on my car. I want to ask about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number or your license plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it. The plate is... one moment. [pause] Okay. It is a ticket for the snow. I parked on the street, and it says no parking in the snow emergency."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Thank you. I have it here. It was issued last Thursday. The fine is listed on the notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I see the amount. But on the paper, it says the fine will go up. How much does it double to? And when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's not paid within the stated period on the notice, the fine doubles. That period is twenty-one days from the issue date, per what's printed on your ticket. So the amount would be twice the original."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-one days. Twice. Okay. Can you say again, please? Twice the amount on the paper, after twenty-one days from Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From the date of issue, yes. That's correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Another thing. This is my first ticket. Never before. Can the first-time fine be waived? Because I did not know about the snow rule that night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is an appeal process. You can submit a written request for review, and a hearing officer decides. I can't tell you the outcome in advance, and I can't waive it over the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:37:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. I am annoyed, because I watch the snow. I write the snowfall totals in a notebook for many years. But that night, nobody told me it was an emergency."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:37:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. If you'd like to appeal, I can mail you the form, or you can pick one up at City Hall during business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:37:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please mail it. I will give the address. It is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Actually, ma'am, we have the address on file with your registration. I'll send it there. Is the best number for you 401-555-0152?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is my number. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:37:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
